  - C. Hybrid – 7 sub-categories
  - D. Life Cycle Funds
  - E. Other – 2 sub-categories
- Market cap definition (full market cap ranking):
  - **Large cap:** 1st–100th · Mid cap: 101st–250th · Small cap: 251st onwards

